    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear the Timeloop - Prologue</strong> is a third-person survival horror set within a time loop.\u00a0Play the first hour of the game in this prologue to the main story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/394bdb7d504824fb37115344edef8b6f.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/394bdb7d504824fb37115344edef8b6f.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/394bdb7d504824fb37115344edef8b6f.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sheriff James Cooper, who wakes up in an unfamiliar room, severely wounded and bleeding. If he doesn\u2019t tend to his injury, he will bleed out within fifteen minutes \u2014 and the cycle will begin again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/921ffb10efef1664aac902acda3cb6f3.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/921ffb10efef1664aac902acda3cb6f3.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/921ffb10efef1664aac902acda3cb6f3.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, despite his critical condition, James must face an even greater threat: bloodthirsty monsters. The building he\u2019s trying to escape from is surrounded by unknown individuals, ready to kill anyone who attempts to step outside.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/fb7b6aabb5ffb221bd8a0e1db3aeb710.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=440 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/fb7b6aabb5ffb221bd8a0e1db3aeb710.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/fb7b6aabb5ffb221bd8a0e1db3aeb710.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A time loop at the core of both story and gameplay mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flexible ability system that can be tailored to your preferred playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dialogue system that reacts to your early choices and the path you take through the loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metroidvania-inspired elements that let you revisit previously inaccessible areas to unlock new abilities and discover valuable items.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/88f9a9f9b18c05210b32f10d7c5383a6.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/88f9a9f9b18c05210b32f10d7c5383a6.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/88f9a9f9b18c05210b32f10d7c5383a6.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear the Timeloop - Prologue</strong> is a third-person survival horror set within a time loop.\u00a0Play the first hour of the game in this prologue to the main story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/394bdb7d504824fb37115344edef8b6f.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/394bdb7d504824fb37115344edef8b6f.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/394bdb7d504824fb37115344edef8b6f.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sheriff James Cooper, who wakes up in an unfamiliar room, severely wounded and bleeding. If he doesn\u2019t tend to his injury, he will bleed out within fifteen minutes \u2014 and the cycle will begin again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/921ffb10efef1664aac902acda3cb6f3.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/921ffb10efef1664aac902acda3cb6f3.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/921ffb10efef1664aac902acda3cb6f3.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, despite his critical condition, James must face an even greater threat: bloodthirsty monsters. The building he\u2019s trying to escape from is surrounded by unknown individuals, ready to kill anyone who attempts to step outside.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/fb7b6aabb5ffb221bd8a0e1db3aeb710.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=440 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/fb7b6aabb5ffb221bd8a0e1db3aeb710.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/fb7b6aabb5ffb221bd8a0e1db3aeb710.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A time loop at the core of both story and gameplay mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flexible ability system that can be tailored to your preferred playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dialogue system that reacts to your early choices and the path you take through the loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metroidvania-inspired elements that let you revisit previously inaccessible areas to unlock new abilities and discover valuable items.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/88f9a9f9b18c05210b32f10d7c5383a6.poster.avif?t=1753348897\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/88f9a9f9b18c05210b32f10d7c5383a6.webm?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642660/extras/88f9a9f9b18c05210b32f10d7c5383a6.mp4?t=1753348897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Sheriff James Cooper is slowly bleeding to death in an unfamiliar hospital. But the moment his life ends, everything starts over. He has fifteen minutes to break this endless cycle, uncover the truth, and find a way out before it's too late.",
